{
  "pages": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "image": {
        "src": "/data/picturebooks/461844-nanna-kelasa-naanu-maadikolluve/p01.jpg",
        "width": 708,
        "height": 508
      },
      "text": [
        "“ನಾನೇ ಬಟ್ಟೆ ಹಾಕಿಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತೇನೆ!",
        "ನನಗೆ ಸಹಾಯ ಬೇಕಿಲ್ಲ.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "image": {
        "src": "/data/picturebooks/461844-nanna-kelasa-naanu-maadikolluve/p02.jpg",
        "width": 708,
        "height": 508
      },
      "text": [
        "“ಅರೆರೆ!”",
        "“ಜಾಣಮರಿ!”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "image": {
        "src": "/data/picturebooks/461844-nanna-kelasa-naanu-maadikolluve/p03.jpg",
        "width": 708,
        "height": 508
      },
      "text": [
        "“ನನಗೆ ಕೊಡಿ. ನೀವು,",
        "ಸುಮ್ಮನೆ ನೋಡ್ತಾ ಇರಿ.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "image": {
        "src": "/data/picturebooks/461844-nanna-kelasa-naanu-maadikolluve/p04.jpg",
        "width": 708,
        "height": 508
      },
      "text": [
        "“ಏನಾಯ್ತು?”",
        "“ಶಹಬಾಸ್!”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "image": {
        "src": "/data/picturebooks/461844-nanna-kelasa-naanu-maadikolluve/p05.jpg",
        "width": 708,
        "height": 508
      },
      "text": [
        "“ಹೇ, ಅದು ನನ್ನ ಚಪ್ಪಲಿ.",
        "ನನಗೆ ಕೊಡಿ.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "image": {
        "src": "/data/picturebooks/461844-nanna-kelasa-naanu-maadikolluve/p06.jpg",
        "width": 708,
        "height": 508
      },
      "text": [
        "“ಅದು... ಹಾಗಲ್ಲ.”",
        "“ಹಾಂ, ಸರಿಯಾಗಿದೆ!”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "image": {
        "src": "/data/picturebooks/461844-nanna-kelasa-naanu-maadikolluve/p07.jpg",
        "width": 708,
        "height": 508
      },
      "text": [
        "“ನೋಡಿ, ನನ್ನ ಕೆಲಸ ನಾನು ಮಾಡಿಕೊಂಡೆ!”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "image": {
        "src": "/data/picturebooks/461844-nanna-kelasa-naanu-maadikolluve/p08.jpg",
        "width": 708,
        "height": 508
